    impact: "If you want better sleep, building mindfulness may help mainly by lowering negative emotions like anxiety, tension, and rumination. For people who score high in neuroticism, mindfulness alone may not be enough, so pairing mindfulness with emotion skills (like stress management, therapy tools, or structured sleep routines) may matter more. This also suggests mindfulness programs on campuses could work best when they include mood support and are tailored to personality differences.",
