    constraints: "This review only included English-language journal or conference articles from selected databases, so it may miss relevant research published in other languages or sources. The final sample was small (21 studies), which limits how confidently the patterns can represent the full global picture. Because studies used different definitions and measurement tools, comparisons across papers are not perfectly clean.",
