    constraints: "Sleep was measured by self-report (PSQI), not objective devices like actigraphy. The sample was limited to school teachers in one region and may not generalize broadly. Adherence challenges and beliefs about psyllium were noted, and the lifestyle program included multiple components, making it hard to pinpoint which part mattered most for sleep.",
