    impact: "If you are forced to take time off (injury, illness, travel), expect endurance fitness to decline quickly, especially in the first couple of weeks. To reduce losses, the review suggests that keeping even a small amount of training, especially at least one higher-intensity session per week, may protect VO2max better than only doing easy training or stopping completely.",
