    title: "Too Much Brain Oxygen",
    excerpt: "After the heart restarted in asphyxiated newborn lambs, the brain received a short burst of excessive oxygen delivery even though it did not use more oxygen.",
    date: "2020.10.05",
    readTime: "30 min",
    journal: "Scientific Reports",
    imageUrl: "https://picsum.photos/seed/Physiology7/800/450",
    keywords: ["Newborn Resuscitation", "Brain Oxygen", "Asphyxia", "Oxygen Therapy", "NIRS", "Cardiac Arrest"],
