    summary: "Researchers used AI to systematically scan major scientific databases and map the carbon dioxide removal (CDR) research field. They estimate around 29,000 CDR studies, which is far more than earlier counts, and they show the research is growing fast but focused heavily on a few topics like biochar and certain regions like China.",
