        "Segmented the airway from CT scans, generated high-resolution meshes, and simulated inspiration in ANSYS FLUENT using a constant flow rate (~14 L/min).",
        "Compared airflow streamlines, velocity patterns, wall shear stress, pressure drop, and calculated airway resistance across models."
