      { title: "Follow Up Later", desc: "After 1.5 years, children completed tests for math, reading, vocabulary, speaking, and parents rated social skills and behavior problems." },
      { title: "Analyze Links", desc: "Statistical models checked how parent relationship quality connects to routines and then to children's later school skills, controlling for family background." }
