      { title: "Daily Evening Report", desc: "In the evening they logged time spent studying, effort put in, focus level, any postponing of tasks, and how satisfied they felt with the day's academic progress." },
      { title: "Track Over Semester", desc: "This continued every day for about five months, covering class time and breaks, then researchers analyzed how one day's habits influenced the next day's motivation." }
