      { title: "Analyze Diseases", desc: "The team mapped how these cell clusters appear in specific organs during the onset of chronic illnesses." },
      { title: "Test Solutions", desc: "They reviewed the effectiveness of new drugs designed to selectively kill these harmful cells without hurting healthy ones." }
