    impact: "This research highlights that aging is not just a passage of time but a biological process that can be targeted. By focusing on clearing 'zombie cells,' we may eventually be able to treat multiple age-related diseases at once rather than one by one.",
    constraints: "It is difficult to target these cells because they are not all the same and some still perform helpful roles in the body.",
