      points: [
        "They searched databases like PubMed for relevant studies published in English between 2000 and 2025.",
        "Included peer-reviewed papers on genetic factors, evolutionary selection from pathogens, and lifestyle impacts on infection risk.",
        "Focused on human data from genome studies, association scans, and evidence of how genes interact with modern environments."
      ]
