    constraints: "The study only lasted one semester and focused on college students at one university, so the results may not apply to younger students or different learning environments. Researchers did not separate the effects of the adaptive technology itself from the extra motivation students might have felt from using new technology. The study also did not track whether students continued to improve after the program ended or compare different types of adaptive learning systems to see which features matter most. Additionally, all students had similar English proficiency at the start, so it is unclear how well the system works for complete beginners or advanced learners.",
